; XSparkFlow - XAUUSD M30 CandleFlow starting point
;
; For XSparkFlow.ex5 on an XAUUSD M30 chart. This is a STARTING POINT, not a
; validated profile: CandleFlow has never been backtested, forward-tested or
; traded. Nothing here is a profitability claim.
;
; The rule it configures: when the M30 candle closes above its open, buy; below
; its open, sell. No take-profit. The stop sits 0.10 x average range beyond that
; candle's far wick, and re-anchors to the far wick of every later closed M30
; candle, tightening only.
;
; Every identifier below carries the InpFlow prefix, which is what keeps this
; file and a ScoreBot_v3 .set from configuring each other: MetaTrader applies a
; preset by identifier, so names that do not exist in the target EA are ignored.
; Loading a ScoreBot preset into XSparkFlow now changes nothing at all.
;
; TO CHANGE TIMEFRAME: attach the EA to a different chart period. Every distance
; here is a multiple of that period's own average range, so nothing in this file
; needs editing. Supported periods: M1, M5, M15, M30, H1, H2, H4.
;
; Risk starts at 1% per trade with trading DISABLED. Set InpFlowEnableTrading=true
; only after a Strategy Tester run and a demo account have shown you what this
; rule actually does - it is in the market far more often than ScoreBot_v3.

InpFlowEnableTrading=false
InpFlowAutoTuneForSymbol=true
InpFlowMaxOpenTrades=1

InpFlowBufferATRMult=0.10
InpFlowBufferRangePct=0.0
InpFlowBufferPoints=0.0
InpFlowMinStopATRMult=0.25
InpFlowMaxStopATRMult=0.0
InpFlowMinBodyATRMult=0.0
InpFlowUseVolatilityGate=false

InpFlowRiskPct=1.0
InpFlowMaxRiskPct=3.5
InpFlowMaxAccountRiskPct=6.0
InpFlowMaxDailyDDPct=15.0
InpFlowUseTotalDDKillSwitch=true
InpFlowMaxTotalDDPct=25.0

InpFlowUseWeekendClose=true
InpFlowWeekendCloseHour=20
InpFlowWeekendCloseMinute=0

InpFlowVerboseLog=false

InpFlowQuietMarketPct=60.0
InpFlowWildMarketPct=600.0
InpFlowEntrySlipPct=25.0
InpFlowExitSlipPct=85.0
InpFlowSpreadCapPct=40.0
InpFlowMaxSpreadATRPct=10.0

InpFlowUseSpreadFilter=true
InpFlowUseStopLevelValidation=true
InpFlowUseMarginCheck=true
InpFlowMarginBufferPct=20.0
InpFlowMaxQuoteAgeSeconds=15

InpFlowMagicNumber=770332
InpFlowOrderComment=CandleFlow_v1
InpFlowClearKillswitchLatch=false
